# roomwatch-onkyou — local secrets. COPY THIS TO ".env" (same folder) AND FILL IN.
# ".env" is git-ignored in public/ and this folder is not a git repo — it never
# leaves the machine except as the HTTPS auth git sends to github.com on push.

# GitHub fine-grained personal access token.
#   - Resource owner  : onkyousama
#   - Repository access: Only select repositories -> onkyousama/technocore-agent
#   - Permissions      : Repository permissions -> Contents: Read and write
#                        (Metadata: Read-only is added automatically)
# Create at: https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens/new
GITHUB_TOKEN=github_pat_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
